  "source": {
    "kind": "probed",
    "captured_at": "2026-10-18",
    "description": "Live ecp-2 queries and commands on the Streaming Stick 4K, with ordered request/response frames. Each request follows successful client-id authentication. Launch and Home notification frames are retained separately; timestamps are observed device uptime. SAS v45 datagrams were received after a successful mobile-sas set-audio-output request while the home screen was silent. No receiver acknowledged the UDP stream during this probe. The probe stopped it with mobile-sas-disconnect. Identifiers and LAN addresses are scrubbed. No response is retained for timed-out requests. No physical TCL was available. Voice service data and channel artwork were deliberately not published."
  },
